<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 16/17.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 16/17.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>16/17. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 16/17	  June 13-16</p>
<p> CZK	0.42698	    0.42769</p>
<p> DKK	2.10179	    2.10135</p>
<p> FIM	2.67052	    2.6689 </p>
<p> HUF	0.07477	    0.07472</p>
<p> JPY	0.12175	    0.12096</p>
<p> LTL	3.46813	    3.45894</p>
<p> LVL     24.30335	   24.23828</p>
<p> RUR	0.00241	    0.0024 </p>
<p> SEK	1.78513	    1.77581</p>
<p> UAH	7.48032	    7.45969</p>
<p> USD     13.876	     13.834  </p>
<p> XEU     15.61674	   15.60683</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
